nd_od06,nd_od06.mietab,2.0,"generated by scripts/tools/gen_registry_rows.py: illustrative absorptive Schott-NG-style neutral density filter, flat internal transmittance 400-1100nm, T=10^-OD=0.251189 at OD0.6, ref_thickness_mm=2.0 (catalog ND step); Beer-Lambert thickness scaling per optprops.py's load_filters(); not a digitized vendor curve"
nd_od10,nd_od10.mietab,2.0,"generated by scripts/tools/gen_registry_rows.py: illustrative absorptive Schott-NG-style neutral density filter, flat internal transmittance 400-1100nm, T=10^-OD=0.1 at OD1.0, ref_thickness_mm=2.0 (catalog ND step); Beer-Lambert thickness scaling per optprops.py's load_filters(); not a digitized vendor curve"
nd_od13,nd_od13.mietab,2.0,"generated by scripts/tools/gen_registry_rows.py: illustrative absorptive Schott-NG-style neutral density filter, flat internal transmittance 400-1100nm, T=10^-OD=0.0501187 at OD1.3, ref_thickness_mm=2.0 (catalog ND step); Beer-Lambert thickness scaling per optprops.py's load_filters(); not a digitized vendor curve"
